# Line coverage floor (root V25): a ratchet read by `sherd coverage --check`.
# It may only rise, and only `sherd coverage --record` moves it. Lowering it
# is a reviewed commit that says why here.
#
# Set 2026-10-17 at the end of wave 1 (root V18): 98.65% of workspace
# lines. Raised 2026-10-25 at the end of wave 3: 99.35%, recorded with no
# GIT_* variable set, as CI runs the gate (dev B1). The gaps are the
# history.rs error path for a git that cannot start, and two dev main.rs
# lines and one names.rs line.
